From dbc13186963e4d49c9f00283d280ea1fff31f0e7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: okty111 <okty111@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:33:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] Add power charts (web + SSD1322) and RS485 Modbus RTU for
 SolarEdge

- PowerLog: 5 min average power of Hoymiles and SolarEdge for today and
  yesterday, persisted in LittleFS /power.bin; GET /api/history/power
- /history: SVG power curve (today/yesterday) and stacked energy bars
  (30 days, months, years), no external libraries
- SSD1322: new page 'Wykres mocy - dzis' (stacked curve, peak, now marker),
  page mask migrated to include it
- SolarEdge: transport selectable Modbus TCP or Modbus RTU over the
  Fusion v2 RS485 transceiver (GPIO16 R, 45 D, 46 DE, 15 RE_N), baud and
  parity configurable; settings page updated

Co-authored-by: Perplexity <noreply@perplexity.ai>
